[I] An IDE for writing GNOME-based software

[T] GNOME Builder is an integrated development environment for writing
[T] GNOME-based software. It features code completion, a debugger, Flatpak
[T] and container support, version control and many plugins for different
[T] languages and build systems.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-builder

